## PHASE 5 — Summaries Feature (Student)

### T-08 · Create `src/js/features/summaries-viewer.js`

This module fetches and renders summary cards on the subject page.

**Key functions to implement:**

```
fetchSummaries(subjectId, db) → Array
  - Query: subject_summaries WHERE subjectId == X ORDER BY order
  - Fallback: unordered query, sort client-side
  - Filter out isActive === false

renderSummaryCard(summary) → HTMLElement
  - type='pdf'   → same PDF embed pattern as roadmap-viewer.js
                    (iframe + "فتح PDF ↗" fallback link)
  - type='text'  → DOMPurify sanitize innerHTML (same guard as roadmap-viewer.js)
  - type='image' → <img> with caption (same pattern as roadmap-viewer.js)

initSummariesViewer(subjectId, db)
  - Fetch summaries
  - If empty: section stays hidden
  - If has content: render into #summariesList, reveal section
```

